        prompts: {
          human: "Old Maid is a timeless children's card game focused on matching and evasion. Using a standard deck with one card removed (or a specialized deck), players aim to pair up all their cards and discard them. The tension lies in the final unmatchable card—the 'Old Maid'. The player left with this card at the end of the game loses. It is a game of simple mechanics, bluffing, and luck.",
